## Saturday night

::bg{location="deck" time="night"}
::music{action="start" mood="romantic" volume="down"}
@narrator: Someone is climbing the last switchback with a torch. Nobody climbs the path at night.
::use{component="enter" who="wren"}
@wren{emotion="shy"}: Don't say anything about the goats. I didn't bring the goats.
@wren: I wanted to see where you are, when you're up here. The village only ever sees the station as a light.
@wren{emotion="fond"}: It's a nice light. I've watched it every night this week.

<branch id="wrenAnswer" prompt="Her torch makes a small warm room of the deck.">
  <choice id="hold" label="Take her hand">
    ::set{run.route = 'wren'}
    @wren{emotion="laughing"}: Oh. Oh, good. I rehearsed a much longer thing.
  </choice>
  <choice id="walk" label="Offer to walk her back down, as a friend">
    @wren{emotion="sad"}: Yeah. Of course. It's steep in the dark.
  </choice>
</branch>
